# Workspace files (.leksah-workspace, formerly .leksah.json) are per-user: the
# IDE rewrites them whenever a project is added or removed, so a tracked one
# collects everyone's local (and private) sibling projects.
*.leksah-workspace
*.leksah.json
*~
